!Other terms
!!Basic

First, direct Pokémon terms: (parentheticals are optional, not advised)
|| __English__|   __Lojban__ | __implied selbri definition__
   Pokémon|   pokrmone   |   x1 is a Pokémon of species x2 and level x3
   Pokémon species| pokrmone jutsi  | x1 is a Pokémon species of type(s) x2 with evolutions/family x3
   Pokémon trainer| pokrmone jitro  | x1 is a Pokémon trainer controlling/directing Pokémon (party) x2 in x3 (battle)
   Pokédex|   cabra be lo pokrmone ku  |   x1 is a Pokédex [[device for recording Pokémon data] controlled by x2
||

